   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Refugee Law Project/Beyond Juba Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till projektet &quot;Beyond Juba&quot; som genomf&#xF6;rs av Refugee Law Project, Makerere University Faculty of Law and Makerere University Human Rights and Peace Center. Projektet omfattar fr&#xE4;mjande av &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa inkl en nationell sanning- och f&#xF6;rsoningsprocess i Uganda, s&#xE5; v&#xE4;l som fr&#xE4;mjande av m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter i Karamoja och HBT personers r&#xE4;ttighteter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the project &quot;Beyond Juba&quot;, Refugee Law Project, Makerere University Faculty of Law and Makerere University Human Rights and Peace Center. The project comprises promotion of transitinal justice includuing a national truth and reconciliation process in Uganda, as well promotion of Human Rights in Karamoja and the rights of LGBTI persons.</narrative>
  </description>
